---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/interactive.css';
---
<Base title="Preparedness Tools | ReadyGearHub" description="Free, browser-based tools: live weather alerts, generator and solar sizers, a water storage calculator, a fridge and freezer outage timer, and a Ready.gov kit builder.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Tools</p>
      <h1>Preparedness tools</h1>
      <p class="lead">Simple calculators and official-alert lookups you can use in the browser. No invented sample data, and no prices on this site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="tools-grid">
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/alerts/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span>
        <h3>Live weather alerts</h3>
        <p>Official National Weather Service alerts by state or county. Default view is Mississippi.</p>
        <span class="count">Open alerts →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/tools/power-sizer/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔋</span>
        <h3>Generator &amp; power-station sizer</h3>
        <p>Add typical appliance watts, see running and starting totals, and estimate battery hours.</p>
        <span class="count">Open sizer →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/tools/solar-sizer/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">☀️</span>
        <h3>Solar &amp; power-station sizer</h3>
        <p>Estimate panel watts and battery watt-hours from your daily load and peak sun hours you look up at NREL.</p>
        <span class="count">Open solar sizer →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/tools/water-calculator/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">💧</span>
        <h3>Water storage calculator</h3>
        <p>Ready.gov’s one gallon per person per day, sized to your household and the number of days you plan for.</p>
        <span class="count">Open water calculator →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/tools/outage-timer/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">❄️</span>
        <h3>Fridge &amp; freezer outage timer</h3>
        <p>A live countdown based on FoodSafety.gov guidance for food kept in an unopened fridge or freezer.</p>
        <span class="count">Open timer →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/tools/kit-builder/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</span>
        <h3>Emergency kit builder</h3>
        <p>A printable checklist from Ready.gov guidance, sized to your household, with links to existing listings.</p>
        <span class="count">Open kit builder →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/apps/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
        <h3>Storm Tracker app</h3>
        <p>Install a small app that saves your county, shows alerts, and works offline with the last cached result.</p>
        <span class="count">Install or open →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card tool-card" href="/widgets/">
        <span class="lane-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔗</span>
        <h3>Embeddable widgets</h3>
        <p>Add a current-alerts badge or a storm-prep countdown to your own site with a copy-paste iframe.</p>
        <span class="count">Build a widget →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
